      "id": "claim_a6a536e28f9c4a779d74ad9e3d32b7e7",
      "statement": "The volsync-new component injects a ${APP} PersistentVolumeClaim (defaults: ReadWriteOnce, 1Gi, topolvm-thin-provisioner, all overridable via VOLSYNC_* vars) plus an ExternalSecret building a restic repository Secret against MinIO (s3:http://192.168.50.220:9010/volsync/dev/${APP}), a ReplicationSource backing up every 6 hours with retention 24h/7d/5w, and a manual-trigger ReplicationDestination for one-shot restores.",
